{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Companions is a &quot;cozy/life simulator&quot;, in which you are an astronaut traveling the vast and unknown universe to explore new worlds and befriending aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find new and strange worlds, land with your dropship, and explore alien vegetation and animal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Make first contact with aliens, be social if you want to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get funds from earth for creating a cosmic community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use your funds for better engines that moves you quicker to the next planet, and more.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It\u00b4s a game designed not to be played in one go, so set a course for the next world. It can take hours to reach it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101850?t=1764533492","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/6d1a2a53b9180109386df2a7681b7dec4cce27b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764533492","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/5fa9bdbb3c249339c3ed2eaeb855902b4c346ff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764533492","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/5fa9bdbb3c249339c3ed2eaeb855902b4c346ff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764533492","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Companions is a &quot;cozy/life simulator&quot;, in which you are an astronaut traveling the vast and unknown universe to explore new worlds and befriending aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find new and strange worlds, land with your dropship, and explore alien vegetation and animal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Make first contact with aliens, be social if you want to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get funds from earth for creating a cosmic community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use your funds for better engines that moves you quicker to the next planet, and more.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It\u00b4s a game designed not to be played in one go, so set a course for the next world. It can take hours to reach it.</p>","developers":["Wintergrim Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101850/61e5b2d71537ef5e29bcc6adcd2c9d3dcedc5bb9/header.jpg?t=1764533492","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2101850/1382539887/7a5347be4facd2c4e44b7d481531cd09266481c8/1764532132/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764533491","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2101850/1382539887/7a5347be4facd2c4e44b7d481531cd09266481c8/1764532132/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764533491","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2101850/1382539887/7a5347be4facd2c4e44b7d481531cd09266481c8/1764532132/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764533491","id":256926547,"name":"Cosmic Companions","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256926547/84a0f1d8bee326012cee3ec36e7e60f2ed1c32cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764533491"}],"name":"Cosmic Companions","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU, Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Wintergrim Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors"